{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>and go</b> — In the Masorah: here, and the other: הנה רבקה לפניך קח ולך (here is Rebekah before you, take [her] and go). נהג ולך with Abishag the Shunammite — teaches that she was a righteous woman like the Matriarchs. And קח משענתי כידך ולך (take my staff in your hand and go). המגלה אשר קראת בה קחנה בידך ולך (the scroll you read in, take it in your hand and go) — teaches that even though it is not explained here that he gave him gifts as with Abimelech, he certainly gave him, and this is קחנה בידך ולך — he gave him something given hand to hand."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:03.466431781Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}